Integrity of vendored material
------------------------------
The files under vendor/msd/ listed in regimes 2 and 3 are unmodified copies of the
upstream artefacts at the pinned commit. Per-file sha256 hashes and byte sizes are
recorded in docs/dependency.md, and the drift check (scripts/check-vendor-drift.mjs,
a CI gate) recomputes and enforces them offline on every build. Any modification to a
vendored file fails the build.

Citation anchor
